## User

The n-th Fibonacci number, with fib 0 = 0 and fib 1 = 1.

## Type

type
```agda
fib : ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
fib 0 = 0
fib 1 = 1
fib (suc (suc n)) = fib n + fib (suc n)
```

## agda

-- The fibonacci number is the sum of the fibonacci numbers
-- of the form n = 0 + 1 + 1 + ... + n = 0
fibonacci : ℕ → ℕ
fibonacci 0 = 0
fibonacci 1 = 1
fibonacci (suc (suc n)) = fibonacci n + fibonacci (suc n)
```

